==Trivia==
*In the comics, Johnny Storm is a member of the [[Fantastic Four]] and brother of [[Sue Storm]] with the ability to generate fire throughout his body. He has also served as a frequent ally and friend to [[Spider-Man]], who is around his age. 
*While Human Torch does not say his comic book catchphrase "Flame on!" in ''[[The Fantastic Four: First Steps]]'', his [[Fantastic Four Action Figures|action figure]] does say the quote before [[Ben Grimm]] crushes the toy. His catchphrase is also used in the comic ''[[Fantastic Four: First Steps]]''.

==Behind the Scenes==
*Human Torch in the [[Marvel Cinematic Universe]] is the fourth live-action incarnation of the character, following incarnations portrayed by [[Jay Underwood]], [[Chris Evans]], and [[Michael B. Jordan]].

